{
  "slug": "atlassian",
  "name": "Atlassian",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Connect to Atlassian products including Jira and Confluence. Search and create issues, access documentation, manage sprints, and integrate your development workflow with Atlassian's collaboration tools.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **6 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (6): `capture-tasks-from-meeting-notes` (Analyze meeting notes to find action items and create Jira tasks for assigned work), `generate-status-report` (Generate project status reports from Jira issues and publish to Confluence), `jira-sprint-dashboard` (Create a visual Jira sprint dashboard from Jira project, space, sprint, board, filter, JQL, work item keys, or…), `search-company-knowledge` (Search across company knowledge bases (Confluence, Jira, internal docs) to find and explain internal concepts, processes, and technical…), `spec-to-backlog` (Automatically convert Confluence specification documents into structured Jira backlogs with Epics and implementation tickets), `triage-issue` (Intelligently triage bug reports and error messages by searching for duplicates in Jira and offering to create new…)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `atlassian`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install atlassian@claude-plugins-official` from `atlassian/atlassian-mcp-server`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
